{title: Kahin To}
{artist: A R Rahman Jaane Tu Ya Jaane Na}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A][A]Kahin to kahin to        [C#m]Hogi wo,
[D][Bm]Duniya jahan tu mere saath hai..        [A][A]Jahan mein, jahan tu,
[C#m][D][Bm]Aur jahan, bass tere mere jazbaat hai,

[C#m][F#m]Hogi jahan subah teri,        [A][E][D]Palko ki, kirano mein,
[C#m][F#m]Lori jahan chand ki,        [A][D]Sune teri baahon mein..

[A][D]Jaane naa kahan wo duniya hai,        [Bm][E]Jaane naa wo hai bhi ya nahi,
[A][D]Jahan meri zindagi mujhse,        [D][E][A]Itni khafa nahi.. - 2

[Bm][C#m]Saasein kho gayi hai kiski aahon mein,        [Bm][C#m]Mein kho gayi hu jaane kiski baahon mein,
[Bm][C#m]Manzilon se raahein doodhti chali,        [Bm][C#m]Kho gayi hai manzil kahin rahon mein..

[A][A]Kahin to, kahin to,        [C#m]Hai nasha..
[D][Bm]Teri meri har mulaqaat mein,        [A][A]Hoton se, hoton ko,
[C#m][D][E]Chumti, o rehte hai hum har baat pe,        [C#m][F#m]Kehti hai fiza jahan,
[A][D]Teri zamin aasmaan..

[C#m][F#m]Jahan hai tu, meri hassi,        [A][D]Meri khushi, meri jaan?

[A][D]Jaane naa kahan wo duniya hai,        [Bm][E]Jaane naa wo hai bhi ya nahi,
[A][D]Jahan meri zindagi mujhse,        [D][E][A]Itni khafa nahi

